omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=soc0XqV-uo0Q7kNvwG7PMG2&_nc_oc=AdoWpiWzqL3V_WKDhAy-Pc8dkQPVQgNSpiolGA84rp0QXJFtSoFlBDcR8a4hkzQq4eM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJRVmCehAN78TNuCneCrf2WR96qJ_6XQbkjzDrM7e-T2w&oe=6AB7E334"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AtG5ao0KaSoQ7kNvwH7RhvI&_nc_oc=AdpT8mZDsAuneAYBg3adPMC5PACGkn2LG6UDjdfbdXFK0CAvLsOHDqMKgGBLxJ1zwc4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLq2tSoAsAWyq0RyeCJP-0Xg1ccBS-1htfrSzy-uckVSQ&oe=6AB7E496"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yUE3rr8Om10Q7kNvwF2he0s&_nc_oc=AdqBwBKL5q7yzKZPvvaHO3MpWXwkxizgSdRJPxy1i7AUMQk4wYL6eja62pA2ebzUR6s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKLf1QZDJPTU9PGqjOHM2ksCpzNKssCG6-VF0fkM5D8qQ&oe=6AB7C177"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://